<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 123,800 MT were off 30 percent from the previous week and 4 percent from the 4-week average.  Mexico (81,000 MT) and Israel (31,000 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 99,800 MT were one-half above the previous week, but off 8 percent from the 4-week average.  The destinations were Japan (58,400 MT), Turkey (22,300 MT), and Mexico (19,100 MT).</p>
</text>
